# Operator-reviewed sha256 pins for schpet/linear-cli release assets.
# Key format: <tag>/<asset>  (matches install-linear-cli.sh's lookup key).
#
# Vetting procedure and revocation semantics: linear/linear-setup.md §3.2
# ("Updating / re-vetting a new release"). Removing a line is the revocation
# mechanism — the installer then refuses that tag as unvetted. Keep entries for
# old tags: they are what make rollback work.
#
# v2.5.0 vetted 2026-08-21: hashes computed locally from the downloaded assets
# AND cross-checked against upstream's published sha256.sum manifest (both
# sources agreed; the Windows asset was additionally verified on the adopting Windows machine
# before first execution). Adopted by a cross-model panel decision + live parity test (2026-08-21).
